# Motorola 68000 assembly: M68000 Family Programmer's Reference Manual (Motorola); requirements/languages/m68k.md
name     m68k asm68k
keyword  move movea moveq movem lea pea add adda addi addq sub suba subi subq muls mulu divs divu and or
keyword  eor not neg clr cmp cmpa cmpi tst bra bsr beq bne bgt blt bge ble jmp jsr rts dbra dbf swap
keyword  ext lsl lsr asl asr rol ror trap link unlk
builtin  d0 d1 d2 d3 d4 d5 d6 d7 a0 a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7 sp pc sr ccr
fold-case
line-comment   ;
string   " "
string   ' '
sigil    .    : meta
sigil    $    : num
operators  #()+-*/,
hook     asm-label
